<title>UK: CNCP-NKBK sets $125 million three-year FRN.</title>
<headline>CNCP-NKBK sets $125 million three-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager J.P. Morgan.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CNCP-NKBK INTERNATIONAL FINANCE</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  CAISSE NATIONALE DE CREDIT PROFESSIONEL (CNCP)</p>
<p> AMT    $125 MLN	BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY	 APR.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     20 BP     PAY DATE    03.APR.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY =	   ISS PRICE  99.863    FULL FEES   20 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   =	   REOFFER    99.863</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/BE/LU</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC  10 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
